[[SECTION]]
UID: L3-G
TITLE: Goals

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
What the element shall achieve. Goals provide the rationale for the element's
existence and guide design decisions. Use cases and technical functions
reference them to show how they contribute.
<<<

